From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dodaskot <pessdres@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 3 Oct 2026 17:58:27 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 028/131] a22x: CPU DVFS via mediatek-cpufreq (ARMPLLs, mcusys
 muxes, CPU rails)

- clk: mediatek: MT6833 armpll_ll/armpll_bl0/ccipll (always on) and mcusys
  CPU muxes; only clk26m and the cluster PLL are usable mux inputs
- cpufreq: mediatek: MT6833 platform data (vendor VSRAM limits), keep
  cpufreq-dt off
- dts: vgpu11/vproc2 + vsram_proc1/2 rails (always on), vendor B20G OPPs;
  LITTLE limited to >= 950 MHz while the CCI shares Vproc2 unscaled

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 .../boot/dts/mediatek/mt6833-samsung-a22x.dts | 263 ++++++++++++++++++
